00:02:15.324 --> 00:02:17.001
Come on!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:20.564
So... lucky!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.030
Well, it's not luck if I aim there

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:26.220
Actually! It didn't touch!

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:26.785
Yes, it did

00:02:26.785 --> 00:02:27.598
No, it didn't!

00:02:27.598 --> 00:02:28.098
Yes, it did

00:02:28.098 --> 00:02:28.640
It didn't

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:29.260
My point

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:29.760
No

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:30.532
My point

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:31.441
Your point

00:02:31.441 --> 00:02:32.091
Yes

00:02:32.091 --> 00:02:32.725
My point

00:02:32.725 --> 00:02:33.374
No

00:02:33.374 --> 00:02:34.060
Yes

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:34.829
No

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.898
Okay, not then

00:02:43.748 --> 00:02:44.646
Come on!

00:03:06.924 --> 00:03:08.361
Chooo!

00:03:26.944 --> 00:03:27.611
Thank you!

00:03:41.364 --> 00:03:42.525
