00:04:29.582 --> 00:04:31.094
Okay Otto, I'm ready!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.513
A wet ball?

00:04:35.882 --> 00:04:37.000
It's your sweat I think

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.327
That's how you want to play this game?

00:04:38.327 --> 00:04:40.071
Mr excuses

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:42.080
Don't get mad

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:42.859
I'm not mad

00:04:42.859 --> 00:04:44.658
I think it's your serve!

00:04:45.216 --> 00:04:46.091
It is my serve

00:04:53.314 --> 00:04:54.326
The racket is too good

00:04:54.326 --> 00:04:57.467
And the bandana... I can't think with that!

00:04:57.793 --> 00:04:58.345
Come on

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:10.021
Something weird on the surface...

00:05:19.271 --> 00:05:20.597
