00:05:20.597 --> 00:05:21.582
Table is this way

00:05:29.749 --> 00:05:31.479
Sorry!

00:05:32.552 --> 00:05:36.190
Well, at least I won the point so I'm happy

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.546
Well done, Emil!

00:05:44.797 --> 00:05:46.281
I bet you didn't see that coming!

00:05:46.281 --> 00:05:47.345
No, I didn't

00:05:57.584 --> 00:05:58.698
